About Anna’s Dad Press

Tell the genuine story clearly and briefly:

Anna created the Learn Math With Anna publishing effort. Its success
and the experience of watching her build useful educational books
inspired her father to begin publishing too. Hence “Anna’s Dad
Press.”

The tone should be personal but not sentimental or over-written.

Add a short section explaining the publishing philosophy: teach
clearly, use visual explanations where they genuinely help, provide
deliberate practice, and make difficult material approachable without
oversimplifying it.

Privacy

